# Keeping the build context small matters here: the repo carries a ~1GB venv
# and node_modules that would otherwise be shipped to the daemon on every build.
.git
.github
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
frontend/dist

# Secrets: backend/.env is mounted at runtime via env_file, never baked into a
# layer — an image with credentials in it leaks them to anyone who can pull it.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local-only notes and generated output
upgrade_roadmap.txt
v0-v1-v2.txt
migrations.sql
CLAUDE.md
.claude
company_icp.txt
scoring_eval_results
adversarial_results
load_test_results
sample_leads_*.csv
*.md
!README.md
